    </view>
    <text style="font-size: 34.62rpx; color: #8A9A95">›</text>
  </view>
  <view style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 23.08rpx; padding: 23.08rpx 26.92rpx; border-radius: 34.62rpx; border: 2.88rpx dashed #C9D4D0">
    <view style="flex: 1">
      <view style="font-size: 26.92rpx; font-weight: 700">邀请康复师一起管理处方</view>
      <view style="font-size: 23.08rpx; color: #5B6663">即将开放 · 康复师可以直接推送和调整动作</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
